    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(18th Level)</em></p><p>You temporarily elevate your community into minor civic-deity mode for a scene.</p><p>For the duration:</p><ul><li><p>Broad stabilization occurs.</p></li><li><p>Panic cannot spread.</p></li><li><p>Cooperative actions are amplified.</p></li><li><p>Protection and solidarity increase dramatically.</p></li></ul><p>This is not a damage spike.<br />It is communal transcendence.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 2+ Surge.</p><h3>Clarification</h3><p>The power flows from the community—not from you alone.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Apotheosis risks Dependence.<br />If communities begin believing they require divine elevation to function, long-term autonomy erodes.</p><p><span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">fvtt-Item-steward_-civic-apothe…</span></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
